<td id="S4.T6.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Cohen’s Kappa (<math id="S4.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>κ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
